# Spend project rules

- Follow `AGENTS.md`. Product rules are in `PRD.md` and `requirements.md`.
- TDD only: failing test before production code. See `.agents/skills/test-driven-development/SKILL.md`.
- Layers: `src/domain` → `src/application` → `src/infrastructure` → `src/presentation`. Routes only in `src/app`.
- No user-visible English/Spanish literals in screens; use i18n.
- Theme tokens from `src/theme`. Light and dark required.
- Time without date is invalid. Missing date and time uses the clock at creation.
- Storage: local Realm-shaped store by default; iCloud only when the account port says available.
- Apple Shortcuts go through `AddExpenseFromShortcut`, not a second write path.
- Keep diffs small. One feature or test slice per commit.
